sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as Client (Public / User / Admin)
    participant BC as BooksController
    participant BS as BooksService
    participant DB as Database

    C->>BC: GET /api/books/readlistcategories
    BC->>BS: readListCategories()
    BS->>DB: SELECT nama_kategori, jenis_buku FROM categories ORDER BY id ASC
    alt daftar kategori kosong
        DB-->>BS: []
        BS-->>BC: NotFoundException
        BC-->>C: 404 "Category not found"
    else error database
        BS-->>BC: InternalServerErrorException
        BC-->>C: 500 "Internal server error"
    else sukses
        DB-->>BS: records
        BS-->>BC: category list
        BC-->>C: 200 {message: "Categories found", data: [...]}
    end
